<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" creator="open-pilgrimages" version="1.1"><metadata><name>Iyo (Temples 39-65)</name><desc>The third of the four dōjō: Temple 39 Enkō-ji to Temple 65 Sankaku-ji, 365.7 km along 26 temple-to-temple henro trail relations. Twenty-six legs of every length — four longer than 30 km, the longest Temple 43 to Temple 44 at 70.3 km, and against them a run of five from Temple 46 to Temple 51 that are each under 5 km. Iyo carries the third of the four stages of spiritual progression the pilgrimage maps onto Shikoku&apos;s four provinces: enlightenment.</desc><copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/</license></copyright><link href="https://open.pilgrimag.es/shikoku-88-iyo"><text>Iyo (Temples 39-65)</text></link></metadata><trk><name>Iyo (Temples 39-65)</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="32.961068" lon="132.774421"/><trkpt lat="32.961071" lon="132.774332"/><trkpt lat="32.961170" lon="132.774102"/><trkpt lat="32.961065" lon="132.774495"/><trkpt lat="32.961068" lon="132.774421"/><trkpt lat="32.961063" lon="132.774536"/><trkpt lat="32.961065" lon="132.774495"/><trkpt lat="32.961062" lon="132.774556"/><trkpt lat="32.961063" lon="132.774536"/><trkpt lat="32.960921" lon="132.774595"/><trkpt lat="32.960999" lon="132.774554"/><trkpt lat="32.961062" lon="132.774556"/><trkpt lat="32.960921" lon="132.774595"/><trkpt lat="32.960933" lon="132.774631"/><trkpt lat="32.960933" lon="132.774654"/><trkpt lat="32.960873" lon="132.774961"/><trkpt lat="32.960824" lon="132.775170"/><trkpt lat="32.960713" lon="132.775883"/><trkpt lat="32.960578" lon="132.776095"/><trkpt lat="32.960438" lon="132.776326"/><trkpt lat="32.960321" lon="132.776485"/><trkpt lat="32.960242" lon="132.776592"/><trkpt lat="32.960149" lon="132.776719"/><trkpt lat="32.959947" lon="132.776908"/><trkpt lat="32.959426" lon="132.777401"/><trkpt lat="32.959256" lon="132.777640"/><trkpt lat="32.959099" lon="132.777816"/><trkpt lat="32.958855"